$comment sample_cell record: 10 pins, every 100 ns (10 MHz), 4096 samples = 409.6 us, 50 before the trigger (rise on clk); first sample at 2.01e+09 ns from RUN $end
$timescale 1ns $end
$scope module fpga $end
$var wire 1 ! clk $end
$var wire 1 " rst $end
$var wire 1 # data $end
$var wire 1 $ cs $end
$var wire 1 % en $end
$var wire 1 & clk_in $end
$var wire 1 ' rst_in $end
$var wire 1 ( data_in $end
$var wire 1 ) cs_in $end
$var wire 1 * en_in $end
$var wire 4 + step $end
$upscope $end
$enddefinitions $end
